using "platforms/cpus/stm32h753.repl"
// VII-B3: as VII-B1, with a monitor hook and access logging set on the guard (displacement test). Candidate (b). The stock rcc stays declared and registered, so its 58 registrations resolve, but is
// moved to a free address (0x58027000); RccGuard takes the RCC's address and forwards to it (`stock: rcc`).
rcc: @ sysbus 0x58027000

rccguard: Tviburi1150.RccGuard @ sysbus 0x58024400
    stock: rcc
